  "body": "Closes #1303\n\n### What changed\n\n- **PR-time drift guard (the surviving scope after the rebase onto #1304):** `scripts/check_lockfiles.sh inventory` (Static gates) now fails when `flutter_app/pubspec.lock`'s `flutter_agent_harness` path pin **diverges from — or is missing entirely vs — the root `pubspec.yaml` version** (gh-1303 class). A missing pin is the same consumer-breaking drift class: `flutter pub get --enforce-lockfile` fails identically, and the realistic path to it is a merge conflict resolved by dropping the hunk.\n- **The original fix landed via #1304:** main now releases with a pinned Flutter SDK in the release job, so `scripts/auto_release.sh` runs a real `flutter pub get` and ships the refreshed lock inside the `chore(release):` commit (+ a post-commit dirty-tree gate over the one lockfile inventory). This PR no longer touches the lock or `auto_release.sh` — it catches every OTHER path to the drift at PR time.\n- Selftest cases 12–16: stale pin reds, synced pin passes, **missing pin reds**, version-less root skips silently, broken `python3` fails cleanly.\n- AGENTS.md note documenting the pin-sync invariant.\n\n### Key decisions\n\n- Kept gh-1265 AC2 (`--enforce-lockfile` = reproducible web builds) — #1304 fixed the skew writer; this guard covers every other path to the drift.\n- A lock with **no** `flutter_agent_harness` entry **reds** (not skips): it fails every `--enforce-lockfile` consumer with the same `Unable to satisfy pubspec.yaml using pubspec.lock` error as gh-1303. Tolerance only for shapes with nothing to compare (root pubspec without a `version:` key → silent skip, selftested).\n- The pin check's `python3` heredoc is guarded like the pod-sync check (`|| fail=1` + `::error::`) — a broken/missing `python3` can no longer kill the inventory run unannotated; both YAML extractions (root version + lock pin) live in that one heredoc.\n\n### How to verify\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/check_lockfiles_selftest.sh               # 16/16: stale red / synced green / missing red / silent skip / broken python3 clean\nbash scripts/check_lockfiles.sh inventory              # real repo: path-pin ok (1.0.517)\ncd flutter_app && flutter pub get --enforce-lockfile   # exits 0 (was exit 65 on main)\ndart test test/release_hygiene_test.dart               # 58 passed\ndart test test/release_flow_race_test.dart             # 39 passed\n```\n\n<details><summary>Failure chain</summary>\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  B[chore(release) bumps pubspec.yaml to vN+1] --> L[app lock still pins harness vN — or the pin is dropped]\n  L --> P[flutter pub get --enforce-lockfile fails, exit 65]\n  P --> R[Pages build red on main]\n  R --> M[merge-trigger gate skips]\n  A[#1304: auto_release.sh re-pins the lock in the bump commit] --> G[check_lockfiles.sh inventory reds every OTHER path to the drift at PR time]\n```\n\n</details>"
}
